{"version":1,"key":"card:400","content":{"id":400,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"C 语言源文件转化为可执行目标程序的流程，以如下源程序为例"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"#include<stdio.h>\n\nint main()\n{\n    printf(\"Hello World!\\n\");\n\n    return 0;\n}","language":"C","uuid":"783df45b-135c-4828-bb3b-2fb643d91a8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B_eff20069-2cc4-42ee-b750-e317bc1d3655.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B_eff20069-2cc4-42ee-b750-e317bc1d3655.png","width":698},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如上图所示，总共分为四个阶段："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"预处理阶段"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对源文件进行预处理，将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"#","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开头的语句进行替换，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"#include","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"#define","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"gcc -E","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以对 C 语言源文件进行预处理"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"gcc -E hello.c -o hello.i","language":"C","uuid":"4b75c620-f338-4dd6-b698-ee3663bda0bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"编译阶段，将预处理的文件转化为汇编语言","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"gcc -S","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将预处理后的文件转化为汇编语言"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"gcc -S hello.i -o hello.s","language":"C","uuid":"e9382ccd-66cb-4bb2-b48c-07bfeeca96d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"汇编阶段，将汇编文件转化机器语言指令，将这些语言指令打包得到一个文件，称之为可重定向目标程序，是一个二进制文件。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"gcc -c","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以将汇编程序转化为可重定向目标程序"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"gcc -c hello.s -o hello.o","language":"bash","uuid":"82542b5f-20f7-4c7f-a819-b3c29ce9e6c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"链接阶段，在源文件中使用了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"printf","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数，这是标准库中的一个函数，我们需要某种方式将该函数合并到我们的可重定向目标程序中，这个合并的过程称之为链接。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"gcc hello.o -o hello","language":"bash","uuid":"6eb8f5a8-fd12-45dc-80c3-d7bf329f6f37","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的整个流程可以通过一个命令搞定"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"gcc hello.c -o hello","language":"bash","uuid":"cd617d77-333d-4766-8163-1aebc9ca91be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之所以分开写，是为了演示整个流程。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}],"tags":["C"],"createTime":1705205302259,"updateTime":1763390361572,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763390361572}}